      "summary_html": "<p>What if abundant intelligence makes human ambition expand rather than human relevance disappear? NLW explores Venkatesh Rao\u2019s \u201cCognitive Mercantilism,\u201d which uses the history of capitalism to challenge assumptions about AI and our intellectual future. From the agricultural revolution to today\u2019s AI agents, the episode examines how cheaper intelligence could unlock new desires, new work, and possibilities we haven\u2019t yet imagined.</p><p><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://contraptions.venkateshrao.com/p/cognitive-mercantilism\">https://contraptions.venkateshrao.com/p/cognitive-mercantilism</a></p><p><strong>Listen to the new How We Got Here with NLW: </strong></p><p><a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/how-we-got-here-with-nlw/id6822359990\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/how-we-got-here-with-nlw/id6822359990\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060</a></p><p><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/7h55KSq0XwIjdWzwF2zgNV?si=cb76360051ec48a0\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060https://open.spotify.com/show/7h55KSq0XwIjdWzwF2zgNV?si=cb76360051ec48a0\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060</a></p><p><strong>Learn More about the AI Champions Program: </strong><a href=\"https://www.besuper.ai/champions\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060https://www.besuper.ai/champions\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060</a></p><p><strong>Brought to you by:</strong></p><p><strong>KPMG</strong> \u2013 New KPMG and UT Austin research shows what separates \u201cAI Amplifiers\u201d from everyone else. Learn more at <a href=\"https://kpmg.com/us/en/articles/2026/ai-redefining-career-success-empower-your-talent-thrive.html?utm_source=the_ai_daily_brief&amp;utm_medium=native&amp;utm_content=podcast&amp;utm_campaign=701dV00000aMKrPQAW&amp;cid=701dV00000aMKrPQAW\"